      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The Higgs-boson discovery completed a central prediction of the Standard Model and was a landmark achievement in experimental particle physics.",
        "attribution": "These three are credited for leadership in the ATLAS and CMS experiments. Their roles represent the work of very large collaborations, creating a hard but familiar challenge for individual attribution.",
        "maturity": "The discovery was confirmed by two independent experiments in 2012, and subsequent measurements have steadily tested the particle's properties.",
        "uncertainties": [
